<br>
I think the cops have every right to shoot your sorry ass if you're running from them. I also think they have the right to pull you over if you are breaking the law, regardless of what color you are.<br>
<br>
I think if you are too stupid to know how a ballot works, I don't want you deciding who should be running the most powerful nation the world for the next four years.<br>
<br>
I worry about dying before I get even.<br>
<br>
